@prefix xml: <http://www.w3.org/XML/1998/namespace> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@base <https://ontoboard.org/patterns/nfdi-role-borne-by-agent.owl> .

<https://ontoboard.org/patterns/nfdi-role-borne-by-agent.owl> rdf:type owl:Ontology .

